 "title": "Review Exercises",
 "content": "<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><body><div class=\"os-eoc os-review-exercises-container\" data-type=\"composite-page\" data-uuid-key=\".review-exercises\" id=\"composite-page-12\" data-book-content=\"true\"><h3 data-type=\"title\">\n    <span class=\"os-text\">Review Exercises</span>\n  </h3>\n  <section data-depth=\"1\" id=\"fs-id1169738040702\" class=\"review-exercises\">\n<p id=\"fs-id1169738040709\"><em data-effect=\"italics\">True or False</em>? Justify the answer with a proof or a counterexample.</p><div data-type=\"exercise\" id=\"fs-id1169738040717\" class=\"os-hasSolution\">\n<div data-type=\"problem\" id=\"fs-id1169738040719\">\n<a class=\"os-number\" href=\"./8b89d172-2927-466f-8661-01abc7ccdba4@8dbc2ce:a329ca25-ddf9-5b35-8d21-8a816d63bb2d.xhtml#fs-id1169738040717-solution\" aria-label=\"Go to 367\" data-page-slug=\"chapter-3\" data-page-uuid=\"a329ca25-ddf9-5b35-8d21-8a816d63bb2d\" data-page-fragment=\"fs-id1169738040717-solution\">367</a><span class=\"os-divider\">. </span>\n<div class=\"os-problem-container\">\n<p id=\"fs-id1169738040721\">Every function has a derivative.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div data-type=\"exercise\" id=\"fs-id1169738040733\">\n<div data-type=\"problem\" id=\"fs-id1169738040735\">\n<span class=\"os-number\">368</span><span class=\"os-divider\">. </span>\n<div class=\"os-problem-container\">\n<p id=\"fs-id1169738040737\">A continuous function has a continuous derivative.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-type=\"exercise\" id=\"fs-id1169738040749\" class=\"os-hasSolution\">\n<div data-type=\"problem\" id=\"fs-id1169738040751\">\n<a class=\"os-number\" href=\"./8b89d172-2927-466f-8661-01abc7ccdba4@8dbc2ce:a329ca25-ddf9-5b35-8d21-8a816d63bb2d.xhtml#fs-id1169738040749-solution\" aria-label=\"Go to 369\" data-page-slug=\"chapter-3\" data-page-uuid=\"a329ca25-ddf9-5b35-8d21-8a816d63bb2d\" data-page-fragment=\"fs-id1169738040749-solution\">369</a><span class=\"os-divider\">. </span>\n<div class=\"os-problem-container\">\n<p id=\"fs-id1169738040753\">A continuous function has a derivative.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n</section>\n</div></body></html>"
